n restoring a link and preserves an explicitly empty activeNodes object, so the bootstrap placeholder remains untyped and unrecoverable.","Supplied production evidence records lane.started with `pending:ed9d9544-8f29-4bf4-bba7-95eae63cb74f`, followed by lane.needs-human after `Async run not found`, while the Forge snapshot remained active with no nodes."]}}
